71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i3LenUKxDoQQ7kNvwF3S353&_nc_oc=AdrK1lqE7MlvPrPNBF_QrvQ8KFaR6mrmqgCFSiO0hodi_oUb5tDOqq5CfrA97DvviE0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF11a44kEW2_-7aVh_DcdejVo-X-jr1z34cSimALAhw0Q&oe=6A830839"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yYN7-NUEEhUQ7kNvwFaSQzi&_nc_oc=Adof0uAPT78YCOmAnzHlQJ1xKMmgL9gIwn5jCFR_QhcfCMyN2WR2kxro9vTm5xj0zcs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHXUu9PMH2O2A3x7KTTe5IibFdauKHMca97Gh6gE7tNbQ&oe=6A82E2D3"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lbpw9oHLNBUQ7kNvwGIs1iE&_nc_oc=AdovgHqumJVuigfo75V7FcmWRtk_oyADH9_RoNJtxlOf901J4hzQximd3uJdQ4O2Ok8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEsvHr9yqKWh1VXEq4JmzxYM1U3pKDkmiMxSnkSLN6Zsw&oe=6A83195A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: